Description: Implements deployment-oriented recalibrated transfer learning for
    survival prediction. The package simulates target, deployment and
    external survival datasets under covariate shift, estimates density-ratio
    weights for covariate-shift correction, fits penalized Cox baseline models, 
    as well as two-step transfer-learning models with or without recalibration toward the
    deployment population. The methodology is described in Pan et al. 
    (2026) <doi:10.1038/s42256-026-01285-x>.
